  "_readme": "certs = SHA-256 (lowercase hex, no colons) of the official signing certificate(s). Apps that rotated their key list every certificate in the lineage (old + new); a match on any one counts. Never add Google Play's 'Source Stamp' certificate (3257d599…): every Play app carries it. Read certs from a genuine Play install with: apksigner verify --print-certs base.apk. Empty certs = not checked yet.",
